# No widget leak on page switches: the app opens and leaves every page (and its Choice and Typed pages) three times at
# start (NET_TOOLBOX_SELFTEST); the objects and timers of Home are counted before and after. Run once with the 0.1 tools
# and once more with the 0.2 pages open on results (the selftest opens Traceroute, HTTP check, Public IP and Whois too) and with the 0.3 pages (Speed test, Wake-on-LAN, a machine, Bluetooth radar).
title Net Toolbox: page switches leak nothing
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1024x600 1280x720
env NET_TOOLBOX_DEMO diag=healthy,ping=mixed,trace=healthy,http=ok,pubip=both,whois=domain,speed=down-mid,wol=awake,wol_machines=3,ble=scan25
env NET_TOOLBOX_FIXTURE deck
env NET_TOOLBOX_SELFTEST 1
shot home
expect text "leak check ok"
